    "element_id": "3c47f30ead50bcbfdce43cd40f7dacdc",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2025-002_MVD..6_KDI_valves_saleable_from_Urbach. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. Stay in touch!   Sign up for our newsletter.   Receive the DUNGS newsletter 6-8 times   a year with information on all aspects of   gas safety- and control technology.  \n\nSign up (English version)     \n\nRepnews  \n\n  \n\n2025-02-25 | #002  \n\nMVD../6 KDI Safety Shutoff Valve portfolio for the US market saleable from Urbach plant 1000\n\nThe MVD../6 KDI Safety Shutoff Valve portfolio will be available as saleable products from Urbach plant 1000 from March 1st., 2025.",
