  {
    "type": "CompositeElement",
    "element_id": "bdc9f2701cdef634d1d78b73ad3e0864",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2025-002_MVD..6_KDI_valves_saleable_from_Urbach. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. This portfolio fulfils the requirements for the US market with the following features:\n\n- Pipe thread: ½” to 3” NPT\n\n- Max operating pressure:\n\no MVD: 7 PSI (500 mbar) fast opening\n\no MVDLE: 3 PSI (200 mbar) slow opening\n\n- Mains voltage:\n\no\n\n24 VAC/60Hz\n\no\n\n110-120 VAC / 60 Hz\n\n- Enclosure rating: NEMA Type 12\n\n- Ambient temperature: -20 °F to +120 °F (-30 °C to 50 °C)\n\n-\n\nApprovals\n\no\n\nUL\n\no CSA (MOP: MVD 5 PSI, MVDLE 2 PSI)\n\no\n\nFM",
