  {
    "type": "CompositeElement",
    "element_id": "48343b5bca1fc178018b0518a7531520",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2025-002_MVD..6_KDI_valves_saleable_from_Urbach. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. In the past, the MVD../6 KDI valves could only be ordered via the US sales channel, plant 1600. This meant that the devices were produced in Urbach, then shipped to the USA and sent back from the USA for sale in Europe.\n\nAffected products\n\nFrom March 1st., 2025 Urbach plant 1000 will be able to ship the below listed variants directly from Urbach.\n\nThe gross price structure is based on the US-Pricebook level converted into Euro.",
